    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40714" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιρρέζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>offer sacrifices at</i> a place, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅθι πάντες ἐπιρρέζεσκον ὁδῖται</span> (
